---
import MasterLayout from "../layouts/MasterLayout.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../components/SectionHeading.astro";
---

<MasterLayout
  title="Quality Control & Assurance | Surya Foods"
  description="Learn about Surya Foods' rigorous rice quality control and assurance process, from cultivation and harvesting to processing, milling, and distribution."
  transparentNav={true}
>
  <!-- ═══════════════════ HERO ═══════════════════ -->
  <section class="relative min-h-[60vh] flex items-center pt-24">
    <img
      src="/images/rice-images/pusa-steam-rice-1.png"
      alt="Quality control inspector checking rice grains"
      class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover"
      loading="eager"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-forest-950/95 via-forest-950/80 to-forest-950/40"></div>

    <div class="relative z-10 container-custom py-20">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-gold-400 mb-4 animate-fade-in">
          OUR COMMITMENT
        </p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-heading font-bold text-white leading-[1.1] mb-6">
          Quality Control &<br />
          <span class="text-gradient-gold">Assurance Process.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-forest-100/90 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-xl">
          At Surya Foods, quality is our top priority. We implement rigorous checks at every stage—from paddy selection to final packaging—to ensure every grain meets international standards.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════ MAIN CONTENT ═══════════════════ -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-cream relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl p-8 md:p-12 lg:p-16 border border-slate-100 relative z-10">
        
        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-slate-600">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-forest-900 mb-6">Introduction</h2>
          <p class="mb-8">
            When it comes to rice, quality is of utmost importance. As a staple food for millions around the world, rice needs to be both nutritious and flavorful. Surya Foods understands this significance and has made quality control our top priority. With decades of experience and expertise, we ensure that every grain goes through rigorous checks to meet the highest standards. Let us delve deeper into the quality control measures taken by Surya Foods to bring you the finest rice on your plate.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-forest-900 mb-6">Our Expertise & Trust</h2>
          <p class="mb-8">
            Being a leading player in the rice export industry, Surya Foods has garnered extensive experience over the years. With our roots firmly planted in the agricultural sector, we have gained valuable insights into the cultivation, processing, and distribution of premium Indian rice.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-8">
            The expertise possessed by Surya Foods distinguishes us from competitors. We have mastered the art of assessing the quality of rice grains, ensuring that only the best make their way to international markets. Our expert team combines traditional methods with modern technology to evaluate factors like grain length, texture, aroma, and cooking characteristics.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-forest-900 mb-6">The Importance of Quality Control</h2>
          <p class="mb-8">
            Proper quality control measures are necessary to maintain nutritional value, taste, and appearance. Let's explore the key aspects of quality control implemented by Surya Foods.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 my-12">
            <!-- Cultivation -->
            <div class="bg-forest-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-forest-100 hover:border-gold-300 transition-colors">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-forest-900 text-gold-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">1</span>
                Cultivation & Harvesting
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
                We work closely with farmers to cultivate rice varieties known for exceptional quality. By providing guidance on seed quality and sustainable cultivation techniques, we ensure the paddy is healthy and pure right from the start. During harvesting, paddy is carefully selected based on maturity and moisture content.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Processing -->
            <div class="bg-forest-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-forest-100 hover:border-gold-300 transition-colors">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-forest-900 text-gold-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">2</span>
                Processing & Milling
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Once the paddy reaches our facilities, it undergoes a meticulous processing procedure. Grains are cleaned to remove impurities. Quality checks are conducted at every stage—including dehusking, optical sorting, polishing, and grading. Experts continuously analyze appearance, texture, and aroma.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Packaging -->
            <div class="bg-forest-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-forest-100 hover:border-gold-300 transition-colors">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-forest-900 text-gold-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">3</span>
                Packaging
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Packaging is a critical aspect of our quality control. The rice is carefully packed in premium food-grade packaging material, ensuring that it remains fresh and protected from external contaminants. The packaging is specifically designed to preserve the signature aroma and taste.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Distribution -->
            <div class="bg-forest-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-forest-100 hover:border-gold-300 transition-colors">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-forest-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                <span class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-forest-900 text-gold-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">4</span>
                Distribution
              </h3>
              <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed">
                To maintain quality during export, Surya Foods utilizes a robust global logistics network. The rice is transported in well-maintained, controlled environments. From our mill in India to your international warehouses, every step guarantees the rice retains its excellence.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-forest-900 mb-6 mt-16">Our Facilities in Action</h2>
          <p class="mb-8">
            Take a look inside our state-of-the-art facilities where our expert team utilizes advanced technology to uphold the highest quality standards.
          </p>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 md:gap-6 my-10 not-prose">
            {[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9].map((num) => (
              <a href={`/images/gallery/quality-${num}.webp`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-md group block bg-forest-900 border border-slate-100 hover:border-gold-300 transition-colors">
                <img 
                  src={`/images/gallery/quality-${num}.webp`} 
                  alt={`Quality Control Process Facility ${num}`} 
                  class="w-full h-48 md:h-64 object-cover group-hover:scale-105 group-hover:opacity-90 transition-all duration-500" 
                  loading="lazy" 
                />
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-3xl font-heading font-bold text-forest-900 mb-6">Conclusion</h2>
          <p>
            Surya Foods stands out as an industry leader when it comes to quality control in the global rice sector. With our experience, expertise, authority, and trust, we have set the benchmark for delivering premium rice to international buyers. Our commitment to stringent quality control measures at every stage ensures that every grain meets the highest standards.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ═══════════════════ CTA ═══════════════════ -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-gradient-to-br from-forest-900 via-forest-800 to-forest-900 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-5">
      <div class="absolute inset-0" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, white 1px, transparent 0); background-size: 40px 40px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative container-custom text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto" data-animate>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl font-heading italic text-gold-300 mb-4">"Excellence in Every Grain"</p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
        Partner with a Trusted Supplier
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-forest-200/70 mb-10 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Experience the Surya Foods difference. Our quality assurance guarantees customer satisfaction and brand loyalty.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-gold">
          Request a Quote
        </a>
        <a href="/products" class="btn-secondary">
          View Our Products
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MasterLayout>
